      "source": "Creates a pass through <a href=\"RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair</code></a> to pass-thru <code>byte</code> objects.",
